For every coding task that may modify project files, generate one short unique deployment ID.

Use only lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens, and underscores.

Before modifying the first project file, run exactly:

```powershell
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ".secure\deploy-diff.ps1" -Mode start -Id "<DEPLOY_ID>"